### Environment Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5050/api
@superAdminToken = ey...
@schoolAdminToken = ey...

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login Super Admin
# @name loginSuperAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@platform.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 3. Login School Admin (Greenwood High)
# @name loginSchoolAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@greenwood.edu",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Register New School (Tenant Onboarding)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register-school
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schoolName": "Oakridge International School",
  "schoolCode": "OIS2026",
  "schoolAddress": "Bowrampet, Hyderabad",
  "schoolContactEmail": "admissions@oakridge.edu",
  "schoolContactPhone": "+91 40-66778899",
  "adminName": "Principal Williams",
  "adminEmail": "principal@oakridge.edu",
  "adminPhone": "+91 40-66778890",
  "adminPassword": "password123"
}

### 5. Get Current User Profile (Me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### 6. Get Dashboard Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### 7. List All Schools (Super Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schools
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### 8. Upload / Create Student Record (School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Oliver Queen",
  "admissionNumber": "GWH-199",
  "class": "Grade 10",
  "section": "A",
  "rollNumber": "18",
  "dob": "2010-05-15",
  "gender": "male",
  "bloodGroup": "O+",
  "academicSession": "2026–27",
  "status": "draft"
}

### 9. Forward Student Record to Super Admin
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/students/STUDENT_ID_HERE/forward
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 10. List Students (Tenant-Scoped with Search & Filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students?class=Grade%2010&status=forwarded&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 11. Verify / Reject Student Record (Super Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/students/STUDENT_ID_HERE/status
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "verified"
}

### 12. Bulk Update Status (Super Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/students/bulk/status
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": ["ID_1", "ID_2"],
  "status": "verified"
}

### 13. Export Single School Excel (.xlsx)
GET {{baseUrl}}/export/school/SCHOOL_ID_HERE/xlsx
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 14. Export All Schools as Multi-Sheet Master Workbook (.xlsx) (Super Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/export/all/xlsx
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### 15. Export Filtered Records (.xlsx)
GET {{baseUrl}}/export/filtered/xlsx?class=Grade%2010&status=verified
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### 16. Export History Log
GET {{baseUrl}}/export/history
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

